    priceBounds: {"low":1999,"high":2499},
    specs: "22 x 60 in. belt · 0–12 mph · -3% to 12% incline · 4.25 CHP · 400 lb capacity · AutoBreeze fan",
    pros: [
      "A 4.25 CHP motor rating with a lifetime motor warranty, the combination long runs need",
      "Decline to -3% for practising downhill sections",
      "A 22 x 60-inch belt and a 400 lb capacity on a folding frame",
      "An AutoBreeze fan that adjusts with the intensity of the workout",
    ],
    cons: [
      "Much of the console is built around iFIT, a paid membership — check the current price",
      "Two years on parts and one year of labour is short cover",
      "Top speed is 12 mph, which limits only quite fast runners",
